"prose": [
{
"from": 158,
"to": 170,
"text": "The gates run on this Windows host during /implement. - **Rust delta:** the delta is test-target-only plus manifests. The workspace lint and test gates run, and none defers. - **No smoke leg:** no product binary behaviour, boot path or harness path changes. `src/` and `crates/viola-e2e/src/`   are untouched (research.md §Files to modify). - **Separate target dir:** the msrv entry uses its own `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` so the pinned toolchain's artifacts are not   churned (host-win32 §Session Additions 2026-09-24). - **CI witnesses:**   - the macOS/Linux halves (the SQOS file compiles out there);   - the `supply-chain` job (root deny, fuzz deny, deny-sync, deny-probes, zizmor);   - `lint` (orphans, lint-probes, G1/G3);   - `test` (per-OS coverage floors: root `tests/*.rs` files count toward the windows function floor, per     `coverage.rs:11`);   - `msrv`, `release`, and both mutation legs with their union."
},
{
"from": 172,
"to": 174,
"text": "  The operator entries at the end read them on the pushed sha. - **One-shot mutating controls:** step 9's remove-the-guard runs are never entries, because the light gate re-runs entries   verbatim. The non-mutating guard probes below re-check their subjects on every re-run."
}
],
